/*
  READYBOT - Bruce-inspired monochrome interface (compile fixes)
  Target: ESP32-C3 Super Mini + SSD1306 OLED 128x64 I2C

  Confirmed wiring:
    OLED SDA -> GPIO 9
    OLED SCL -> GPIO 10
    Button  -> GPIO 1 and GND (INPUT_PULLUP)

  Libraries:
    - Adafruit GFX Library
    - Adafruit SSD1306
    - ESP32 board package (WiFi and BLE are included)

  No clock screen, no battery estimate, no weather, no web server.
  Wi-Fi/BLE are started only when their scanner is selected.
  Wireless features are passive scanners only.
*/

